### Auth APIs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/signup HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "sample",
    "email": "sample@gmail.com",
    "password": "Sample@123",
    "age": 20
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sample@gmail.com",
    "password": "Sample@123"
}